@baseUrl = http://localhost:53425
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Register (sample account, change the credentials)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"student@example.com","password":"ExamplePassword!2026","fullName":"Test Student"}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"student@example.com","password":"ExamplePassword!2026"}

### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Activate Owner; replace token with the new accessToken from the response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/roles/owner
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Activate Organizer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/roles/organizer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
